<title>FINLAND: ICE HOCKEY-CANADA WIN WORLD TITLE.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-CANADA WIN WORLD TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada beat Sweden 2-1 on Wednesday to win the world ice hockey championship.</p>
<p>They won the best-of-three final 2-1.</p>
</text>
